		imageAlt="D&D Land Works equipment grading a site-prep job in Lane County, Oregon"
		imageSide="right"
		badgeValue="CCB #261742"
		badgeLabel="Licensed & Bonded"
		ctaLabel="Get a Free Estimate"
		ctaHref="/contact"
		bodyHtml="<p>D&amp;D Land Works is licensed and bonded under Oregon CCB #261742, and DEQ certified for septic install and repair &mdash; credentials you can verify yourself at the <a href='https://search.ccb.state.or.us/search/' class='text-brand-blue underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-brand-blue-dark'>CCB&rsquo;s own license lookup</a> before you ever pick up the phone.</p><p>David Deggelman owns the company and walks every site personally before quoting, so your estimate reflects your lot&rsquo;s actual soil, slope, and access, not a generic number. There&rsquo;s no subcontracted crew and no call-center handoff: the person who scopes your site-prep job is the one who runs the equipment on it. If you&rsquo;re planning a new build, ADU, or commercial pad anywhere in Eugene, Springfield, or the rest of Lane County, <a href='/contact' class='text-brand-blue underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-brand-blue-dark'>contact D&amp;D Land Works</a> to schedule your free, on-site estimate.</p>"
	/>
